  Both import the same [38;5;153mclient.py[39m functions, so [38;5;153mverify=False[39m on those two [38;5;153mrequests.get[39m calls disables TLS certificate
  validation for the [1mproduction[0m run as well. That makes the nightly finance export accept any certificate — a MITM on
