     keeps normal verification.
  2. [1mScope the opt-out[0m — add a [38;5;153mREPORTS_VERIFY_TLS[39m env var read in [38;5;153mclient.py[39m, defaulting to on, and set it to off only in
     [38;5;153msync_staging.py[39m. Still disables checks for staging, but production can't inherit it by accident.

